Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}怎么了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What is it?{\r}
