Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对  对  没错{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes, yes, yes.{\r}
