Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.46,0:01:51.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你在写什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What are you writing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.84,0:01:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}约书亚明天要来{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, Joshua's coming in tomorrow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.47,0:01:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}因为我没胆儿约他出来{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and since I don't have the guts to ask him out...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.18,0:01:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}所以我打算卖他件衣服   然后把这纸条塞进口袋里{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...I'm gonna sell him a coat and put this note in the pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.01,0:02:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是吗  是{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, yeah? Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:04.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}"约书亚  有空打电话给我  你这样的男人…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}"Joshua, give me a call sometime. Guys like you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.06,0:02:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}…永不过时"{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...never go out of style."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.40,0:02:10.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你都扔了哪些话啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What did you throw away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.65,0:02:15.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}伙计们  嗨  你们干什么去了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hi, guys. Hey, what have you guys been up to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.86,0:02:19.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们去Cupert-Hewitt博物馆  看维多利亚时期门把展{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, we went to see a collection of Victorian doorknobs at the Cooper-Hewitt museum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.20,0:02:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没带-我{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Without me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.29,0:02:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是我舅舅拖我们去的   结果很有意思{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}My uncle dragged us there, but actually it turned out to be interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.54,0:02:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是啊  那些门把很华丽{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah. They were so ornate and beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我是说  你们看{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I mean, look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.25,0:02:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不知道英国的国情{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I don't know how museums work in England...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但这里  不能顺手牵羊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...but here, you're not supposed to take stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.05,0:02:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这是礼品部的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I, uh... I got it from the gift shop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那里没什么防盗措施{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}They have really lax security there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.35,0:02:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}开个玩笑{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's a joke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.23,0:02:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}拜{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.31,0:02:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}制片: 塔德史帝文斯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我该走了  再见  我会想你们的  拜拜{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Right, I've got to be off. I'll see you. Bye-bye, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.61,0:02:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}再见{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.94,0:02:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}看起来你们相处得很愉快嘛{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wow. Hey, you guys seem to be having a good time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.61,0:02:59.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对啊  她人很棒   而且很有趣{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, yeah, she is amazing, and she's so much fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}还有  你知道吗  跟她在一起时  我也相当有趣{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And you know what? When I'm with her, I'm fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.46,0:03:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我甚至报名学开直升机{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I even signed up for helicopter classes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.38,0:03:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她过两天就走了  我其实不用这样{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She's leaving in two days. I don't have to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.76,0:03:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}过两天  你一定很失落吧  是啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Aw, two days? You must be bummed. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.05,0:03:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她非回伦敦不可{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She's got to go back to London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但你知道吗  我一开始就有心理准备{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But you know what? I've been prepared for this from the start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.64,0:03:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们都知道我们彼此只有这两星期  仅此而已{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}We both knew we had two weeks together and then that's it, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.35,0:03:25.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我的每段恋情也都是这样{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, that's what all my relationships are like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.77,0:03:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对  但是罗斯他们是"双方"都知道  只有两星期而已{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes, but in Ross' case, they both know in two weeks that's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.11,0:03:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}菲比  嗨{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Pheebs, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:36.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}宝宝  好啊  好啦  我知道{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hello, hello. Yeah, I know. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这孩子就喜欢肉{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So the baby is totally craving meat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.37,0:03:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}下午我想用素汉堡骗骗他{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}This afternoon, I tried tricking it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.08,0:03:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我做了个素汉堡  就是让他以为他吃到肉了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I made it a soy burger so that maybe it'd think it was getting meat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.12,0:03:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}然后  我又恶心了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know? And I got nauseous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:51.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}也许是因为素汉堡太难吃{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, maybe that's because soy burgers suck.{\r}
